---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

---
<SiteLayout title="Terms & Conditions | Hostamble" description="Read the current Hostamble terms & conditions from the supplied original website source." canonicalPath="/legal-agreement.html">
<div class="ace-breadcrumb-area breadcrumb-style-1 pt--150 pt_md--100 pt_sm--100 pb--100 bg-image"><div class="container"><h1>Terms & Conditions</h1><a href="/">Home</a></div></div>
<div class="ace-privacy-policy-area ace-privacy-policy ace-section-gap bg-color-white">
<div class="container">
<div class="row g-5">
<div class="content">
<div class="thumbnail mb--50">
<img alt="Images" class="radius-small w-100" src="assets/images/privacypolicy.jpg"/>
</div>
<h4 class="title">Media Streaming and Downloading Sites</h4>
<p>The hosting of media streaming and downloading sites is strictly prohibited. Non-compliance
                            will result in immediate account suspension without eligibility for refunds.</p>
<h4 class="title">No Freenom Domains Allowed</h4>
<p>In the pursuit of maintaining service excellence and fortified security protocols, we have
                            implemented domain usage restrictions. This is in response to prior instances of
                            spam-related activities specifically associated with Freenom domains. We genuinely
                            appreciate your understanding and cooperation, as we work diligently to ensure an enhanced
                            and secure digital environment for all our esteemed users. Your ongoing support is truly
                            valued.</p>
<h4 class="title">Domain Transfer</h4>
<p> Domains cannot be transferred or unlocked within 60 days of registration or ownership
                            change, as per ICANN policy. </p>
<h4 class="title">.IN Domain KYC Requirement</h4>
<p>Customers registering or maintaining a .IN domain must provide accurate information and
                            complete any KYC/eKYC verification required by the .IN Registry (NIXI) or the Registrar.
                            Failure to complete required verification may result in the domain being placed on hold,
                            suspended, or otherwise restricted in accordance with applicable registry policies and
                            requirements.</p>
<h4 class="title">Backup and Data</h4>
<p>Site data will be automatically terminated after 30 days of overdue status. Renewal within 5
                            days of termination allows data retrieval; after this period, data retrieval cannot be
                            assured.</p>
<h4 class="title">Adult Domain Registration</h4>
<p>Registration of adult domains is prohibited. Any such domains will be terminated without
                            refund. Your compliance ensures a respectful online environment for all.</p>
<h4 class="title">Premium Domains</h4>
<p>Premium domains may have higher pricing and specific terms set by registries. If a premium
                            domain is ordered, the order will be automatically canceled, and a refund will be issued to
                            your account.</p>
<h4 class="title">Adult Site or Content</h4>
<p>We strictly prohibit the registration and hosting of adult-oriented sites or content on our
                            platform. Any violation will result in immediate termination without eligibility for
                            refunds. Our commitment is to maintain a safe and inclusive online community.</p>
<h4 class="title">Spamming</h4>
<p>The transmission of unsolicited bulk or commercial messages (spamming) is strictly
                            prohibited. This applies regardless of potential server overload or disruption to
                            Hostamble.com's services. Hostamble retains the exclusive authority to determine violations
                            of this policy. Repeated violations, as reported by multiple sources, may result in account
                            suspension.</p>
<h4 class="title">Viruses and Other Destructive Activities</h4>
<p>Using Hostamble.com's services or equipment to create, send viruses, worms, or engage in
                            activities like pinging, flooding, mail bombing, or denial of service attacks is not
                            allowed. Such actions may lead to account termination within 24 hours without refund.</p>
<h4 class="title">Debit Card &amp; Credit Card Conditions</h4>
<p>Upon adding your card, you grant authorization for automatic payments. Card details cannot be
                            deleted to enhance fraud protection. Your understanding is appreciated.</p>
<h4 class="title">Illegal Use</h4>
<p>Hostamble.com services are to be used exclusively for lawful purposes. Prohibited activities
                            include transmitting, storing, or distributing information that violates laws or
                            regulations. This encompasses copyrighted, trademarked, or confidential material used
                            without proper authorization, as well as content that is obscene, defamatory, constitutes an
                            illegal threat, or violates export control laws.</p>
<h4 class="title">System and Network Abuse</h4>
<p>Engaging in system or network security breaches is strictly prohibited and may lead to legal
                            consequences. Such breaches include unauthorized data access or system use, service
                            disruption to users, hosts, or networks (e.g., mail bombing, flooding, overload attempts,
                            broadcast attacks), and forging TCP-IP packet headers or email/newsgroup header information.
                        </p>
<h4 class="title">Pornography</h4>
<p>The utilization of Hostamble.com's services to store, post, display, transmit, advertise, or
                            make available any form of pornography is strictly forbidden. Hostamble is obligated by law
                            to notify law enforcement agencies upon detecting the presence or transmission of
                            pornography through its services.</p>
<h4 class="title">Software/WebPanel/API Change</h4>
<p>Should there be a price adjustment for third-party Software/WebPanel/API, customers are
                            obliged to adhere to the updated pricing. A separate invoice will be issued, requiring
                            payment. Failure to comply may result in account suspension or termination by Hostamble.</p>
<h4 class="title">Refund Policy</h4>
<p>Refunds for shared hosting packages are granted within 7 days of order, solely if issues
                            remain unresolved. Refunds are issued to your Hostamble wallet.</p>
<p>We are not responsible for any data breach, loss, or unauthorized access. It is the user's
                            responsibility to ensure data security. Full cPanel access is provided; users are
                            responsible for regular backups, especially before updates or changes. Free backup service
                            is provided as a convenience; daily backups are available in the paid backup service. Users
                            are encouraged to secure cPanel access credentials to prevent unauthorized access. The paid
                            backup service includes daily backups for added convenience. Limitation of liability: We are
                            not liable for any direct, indirect, or consequential damages, including data loss. We
                            reserve the right to modify these terms, with users notified of any changes.</p>
<p>Refund Policy lasts only 7 days. You are eligible to request your refund within seven days of
                            the first payment. After that, you will not get any refund. On second payment, you will not
                            be able to refund your money. You are only eligible to get your money back only if we cannot
                            solve your problem related to the server or your cPanel, Direct Admin Panel, Managed
                            WordPress, Reseller Hosting, etc. Only annual subscriptions will be eligible for a refund.
                            We are not sure that we will solve your VPS problem as we do not offer Managed VPS Server
                            and Managed Dedicated Server. We do not refund the money used to purchase a domain from
                            Hostamble. We will not refund on any kind of upgrade and downgrade in any plan. Refund will
                            be settled to your bank account within 5-7 business days.</p>
<h4 class="title">Cancellation Policy</h4>
<p>We are eligible to cancel your account if it goes against our Privacy Policy and Terms and
                            Conditions.</p>
<h4 class="title">Free Domain Policy</h4>
<p>Any domain you got from Hostamble.com for free will not change its nameserver pointing to
                            another IP or transfer or migrate to another domain registrar or provider.</p>
<h4 class="title">Technical Issue Policy</h4>
<p>If due to any technical glitch, you see the pricing of the product is dropped and you place
                            the order, it will not be considered and your order will be canceled and your money will be
                            refunded within 5 days.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</SiteLayout>
